#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:12(title)
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:16(secondary)
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:22(primary)
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:20(title)
msgid "Adding Fonts"
msgstr "Lägg till typsnitt"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:23(secondary)
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:26(primary)
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:135(primary)
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Typsnitt"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:27(secondary)
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Lägg till"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:29(para)
msgid ""
"GIMP uses the <link linkend=\"bibliography-online-freetype\">FreeType "
"2</link> font engine to render fonts, and a system called Fontconfig to "
"manage them. FreeType 2 supports many common font file formats."
msgstr ""
"GIMP använder typsnittsmotorn <link linkend=\"bibliography-online-"
"freetype\">FreeType 2</link> för att återge text med typsnitt. Systemet "
"Fontconfig hanterar typsnitten. FreeType 2 stöder många vanliga "
"typsnittsformat."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:34(para)
msgid ""
"Any font in Fontconfig's font path is available in GIMP. In addition, any "
"font which is located in GIMP's <guilabel>Font Folders</guilabel> is "
"available in GIMP. Font Folders are set on the <guilabel>Fonts</guilabel> "
"page in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-folders-data\">Folders</link> "
"preferences."
msgstr ""
"Alla typsnitt i Fontconfigs sökväg är tillgängliga i GIMP. Du kan också "
"använda typsnitt i GIMPs <guilabel>typsnittsmappar</guilabel>. Dessa mappar "
"ställs in på sidan <guilabel>Typsnitt</guilabel> i inställningarna för <link"
" linkend=\"gimp-prefs-folders-data\">Mappar</link>."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:41(para)
msgid ""
"By default, there are two <guilabel>Font Folders</guilabel>: The system GIMP"
" fonts folder (which you should not alter), and a <filename>fonts</filename>"
" folder inside your personal GIMP directory. You can also add additional "
"font folders if wanted."
msgstr ""
"Som standard finns två <guilabel>typsnittsmappar</guilabel>: GIMPs "
"systemmapp för typsnitt, som du inte bör ändra, och mappen "
"<filename>fonts</filename> i din personliga GIMP-katalog. Du kan lägga till "
"fler typsnittsmappar om du vill."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:50(title)
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:51(para)
msgid "There are several ways to install a font:"
msgstr "Det finns flera sätt att installera ett typsnitt:"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:53(para)
msgid ""
"Use an application like <application>GNOME Fonts</application> or "
"<application>KFontView</application> to install the font."
msgstr ""
"Använd ett program som <application>GNOME Typsnitt</application> eller "
"<application>KFontView</application> för att installera typsnittet."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:59(para)
msgid ""
"Place the font file in the directory "
"<filename>~/.local/share/fonts/</filename>. This will make the font "
"available to you only."
msgstr ""
"Lägg typsnittsfilen i katalogen <filename>~/.local/share/fonts/</filename>. "
"Då blir typsnittet tillgängligt bara för dig."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:66(para)
msgid ""
"If you have administrator rights, place the font file in the directory "
"<filename>/usr/local/share/fonts/</filename>. This will make the font "
"available to all users."
msgstr ""
"Om du har administratörsbehörighet lägger du typsnittsfilen i katalogen "
"<filename>/usr/local/share/fonts/</filename>. Då blir typsnittet "
"tillgängligt för alla användare."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:73(para)
msgid ""
"In all cases, the font will become available to all programs that use "
"Fontconfig."
msgstr "Typsnittet blir tillgängligt i alla program som använder Fontconfig."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:80(title)
msgid "Microsoft Windows"
msgstr "Microsoft Windows"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:81(para)
msgid "There are several ways to install a font system-wide:"
msgstr "Det finns flera sätt att installera ett typsnitt för hela systemet:"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:83(para)
msgid ""
"Drag the font file into the Fonts directory <filename "
"role=\"html\">C:\\Windows\\Fonts</filename><filename "
"role=\"tex\">C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Dra typsnittsfilen till katalogen Fonts: <filename "
"role=\"html\">C:\\Windows\\Fonts</filename><filename "
"role=\"tex\">C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts</filename>."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:90(para)
msgid ""
"Install the font via the <application>Settings</application> app. In "
"Windows, go to <guilabel>Settings</guilabel>, select "
"<guilabel>Personalization</guilabel>, then from there go to "
"<guilabel>Fonts</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Installera typsnittet via appen <application>Inställningar</application>. I "
"Windows öppnar du <guilabel>Inställningar</guilabel>, väljer "
"<guilabel>Anpassning</guilabel> och sedan <guilabel>Teckensnitt</guilabel>."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:101(title)
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#. https://support.apple.com/guide/font-book/welcome/mac
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:104(para)
msgid ""
"Install the font via the <application>Font Book</application> application."
msgstr ""
"Installera typsnittet med programmet <application>Font Book</application>."

# TODO: want to use it -> want to use them?
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:111(para)
msgid ""
"The installed fonts will show up the next time you start GIMP. If you want "
"to use it in an already running GIMP instance, press the "
"<emphasis>Refresh</emphasis><placeholder-1/> button in the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-font-dialog\">Fonts dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"De installerade typsnitten visas nästa gång du startar GIMP. Om du vill "
"använda ett typsnitt medan GIMP redan körs klickar du på knappen "
"<emphasis>Uppdatera</emphasis><placeholder-1/> i <link linkend=\"gimp-font-"
"dialog\">dialogrutan Typsnitt</link>."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:125(para)
msgid ""
"If for some reason you run into problems trying to install a font system-"
"wide, try to install the font in the <filename>fonts</filename> folder of "
"your personal GIMP directory instead (see above)."
msgstr ""
"Om det inte går att installera ett typsnitt för alla användare kan du i "
"stället lägga det i mappen <filename>fonts</filename> i din personliga GIMP-"
"katalog (se ovan)."

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:133(title)
msgid "Font Problems"
msgstr "Typsnittsproblem"

#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:136(secondary)
msgid "Problems"
msgstr "Problem"

# TODO: Suggestion on better solution?? Remove fonts to find the malformed
# one?
#: src/using/fonts-and-text.xml:138(para)
msgid ""
"In most cases, problems with fonts are caused by malformed font files or "
"outdated font formats. If you experience crashes at start-up when GIMP scans"
" your font directories, as a quick workaround you can start GIMP with the "
"<filename>--no-fonts</filename><link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-running-"
"command-line\">command line argument</link>, but then you will not be able "
"to use the text tool."
msgstr ""
"Typsnittsproblem beror oftast på felaktiga typsnittsfiler eller föråldrade "
"typsnittsformat. Om GIMP kraschar vid start när programmet söker igenom "
"typsnittskatalogerna kan du tillfälligt starta det med "
"kommandoradsargumentet <filename>--no-fonts</filename>, som beskrivs i <link"
" linkend=\"gimp-concepts-running-command-line\">avsnittet om "
"kommandoradsargument</link>. Då kan du dock inte använda textverktyget."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:18(para)
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> is capable of reading and writing a large variety of"
" graphics file formats. With the exception of <acronym>GIMP</acronym>'s "
"native XCF file format, file handling is done by plug-ins. This makes it "
"relatively easy to extend <acronym>GIMP</acronym> to support new file types "
"when the need arises."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> kan läsa och skriva många olika grafikformat. Med "
"undantag för <acronym>GIMP</acronym>s eget XCF-format hanteras filformaten "
"av insticksmoduler. Det gör det relativt enkelt att lägga till stöd för nya "
"filtyper när behov uppstår. <acronym>GIMP</acronym>"

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:27(title)
msgid "Save / Export Images"
msgstr "Spara / exportera bilder"

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:29(primary)
msgid "Save/Export Images"
msgstr "Spara/exportera bilder"

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:32(primary)
msgid "Export Images"
msgstr "Exportera bilder"

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:35(para)
msgid ""
"When you open an image, let's say in JPG or PNG file format, it is imported "
"into <acronym>GIMP</acronym>'s own XCF format, as a new project."
msgstr ""
"När du öppnar en bild, till exempel i JPG- eller PNG-format, importeras den "
"som ett nytt projekt i <acronym>GIMP</acronym>s eget XCF-format."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:39(para)
msgid ""
"For example, a <quote>sunflower.png</quote> image will be loaded as "
"<quote>*[sunflower] (imported)-1.0 (indexed color, 1 layer)</quote>. The "
"leading asterisk indicates that this file has been changed. This image can "
"be saved as <quote>sunflower.xcf</quote> by using the "
"<command>Save</command> command. If you need your image in another format, "
"you should use the <command>Export</command> command."
msgstr ""
"En bild som heter <quote>sunflower.png</quote> läses till exempel in som "
"<quote>*[sunflower] (importerad)-1.0 (Indexerad färg, 1 lager)</quote>. Den "
"inledande asterisken visar att bilden har ändrats. Du kan spara den som "
"<quote>sunflower.xcf</quote> med kommandot <command>Spara</command>. Om du "
"behöver bilden i ett annat format använder du kommandot "
"<command>Exportera</command>."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:48(para)
msgid ""
"When you are finished working with an image, you will save the results. In "
"fact, it is often a good idea to save at intermediate stages too. "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> is a pretty robust program, but on rare occasions "
"crashes have happened."
msgstr ""
"När du är klar sparar du resultatet. Det är ofta bra att spara även under "
"arbetets gång. <acronym>GIMP</acronym> är stabilt, men krascher kan inträffa"
" i sällsynta fall."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:54(para)
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>'s native format XCF is special. It is the only "
"format that can store <emphasis>everything</emphasis> about an image (with "
"the exception of <quote>undo</quote> information). This is the reason that "
"saving can only be done in this format. It makes the XCF format especially "
"suited for storing intermediate results, and for saving images to be re-"
"opened later in <acronym>GIMP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>s eget XCF-format är speciellt. Det är det enda "
"formatet som kan lagra <emphasis>allt</emphasis> om en bild, förutom "
"<quote>ångra</quote>-informationen. Därför kan du bara spara bilder i det "
"här formatet. XCF passar särskilt bra för att spara mellanresultat och "
"bilder som du vill fortsätta arbeta med i <acronym>GIMP</acronym> senare."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:63(para)
msgid ""
"XCF files are not readable by most other programs that display images. Once "
"you have finished editing your image, you can export it to the format of "
"your choice. <acronym>GIMP</acronym> supports a wide range of formats. Most "
"file formats that can be imported, can also be used for exporting."
msgstr ""
"De flesta andra bildvisningsprogram kan inte läsa XCF-filer. När du har "
"redigerat klart kan du exportera bilden i valfritt format. "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> stöder många format. De flesta format som går att "
"importera kan också användas vid export."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:73(title)
msgid "File Formats"
msgstr "Filformat"

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:74(para)
msgid ""
"There are several commands for <emphasis>saving</emphasis> and <emphasis> "
"exporting</emphasis> images. They are listed in the section covering the "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-file-menu\">File Menu</link>. More information on how "
"to use them can be found there."
msgstr ""
"Flera kommandon låter dig <emphasis>spara</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>exportera</emphasis> bilder. De finns i avsnittet om <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-file-menu\">menyn Arkiv</link>. Där finns också mer "
"information om hur du använder dem."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:80(para)
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> allows you to <emphasis>export</emphasis> the images"
" you create in a wide variety of formats. It is important to realize that "
"the only format capable of saving <emphasis>all</emphasis> of the "
"information in an image, including layers, transparency, etc., is GIMP's "
"native XCF format. Every other format preserves some image properties and "
"loses others. It is up to you to understand the capabilities of the format "
"you choose."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> kan <emphasis>exportera</emphasis> bilder i många "
"olika format. Kom ihåg att bara GIMPs eget XCF-format kan spara "
"<emphasis>all</emphasis> information i en bild, inklusive lager och "
"genomskinlighet. Alla andra format bevarar vissa bildegenskaper och förlorar"
" andra. Du behöver känna till vad formatet du väljer kan hantera."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:88(para)
msgid ""
"Exporting an image does not modify the image itself, so you do not lose "
"anything by exporting. See <link linkend=\"gimp-export-dialog\">Export "
"file</link>."
msgstr ""
"När du exporterar ändras inte själva bilden, så du förlorar ingen "
"information. Se <link linkend=\"gimp-export-dialog\">Exportera fil</link>."

#: src/using/fileformats.xml:94(para)
msgid ""
"When you close an image (possibly by quitting GIMP), you are warned if the "
"image has been changed without subsequently being saved (an asterisk is in "
"front of the image name in the title bar of the main window)."
msgstr ""
"Om du stänger en ändrad bild utan att spara den får du en varning. Det "
"gäller även om du avslutar GIMP. En asterisk visas framför bildnamnet i "
"huvudfönstrets namnlist när bilden har ändrats sedan den senast sparades."

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:16(title)
msgid "Customize Splash-Screen"
msgstr "Anpassa startbilden"

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:20(secondary)
#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:23(primary)
msgid "Splash-screen"
msgstr "Startbild"

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:26(para)
msgid ""
"When you start <acronym>GIMP</acronym>, you see the <emphasis>splash-"
"screen</emphasis> displaying short status messages while the program is "
"loading all its components."
msgstr ""
"När du startar <acronym>GIMP</acronym> visas en "
"<emphasis>startbild</emphasis> med korta statusmeddelanden medan programmets"
" komponenter läses in."

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:31(para)
msgid "You can customize the splash-screen:"
msgstr "Du kan anpassa startbilden:"

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:36(para)
msgid ""
"Create a <filename class=\"directory\">splashes</filename> directory inside "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-setup\">your personal GIMP configuration "
"folder</link>."
msgstr ""
"Skapa katalogen <filename class=\"directory\">splashes</filename> i <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-concepts-setup\">din personliga GIMP-"
"konfigurationsmapp</link>."

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:42(para)
msgid ""
"Copy your image(s) into this <filename "
"class=\"directory\">splashes</filename> directory."
msgstr ""
"Kopiera en eller flera bilder till katalogen <filename "
"class=\"directory\">splashes</filename>."

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:48(para)
msgid ""
"On start, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> will read this directory and choose one of"
" the images at random."
msgstr ""
"När GIMP startar läser <acronym>GIMP</acronym> in katalogen och väljer en av"
" bilderna slumpmässigt."

#: src/using/customize-splashscreen.xml:54(para)
msgid "Make sure that your images aren't too small."
msgstr "Se till att bilderna inte är för små."

