#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:9(title)
msgid "Creating a brush quickly"
msgstr "Skapa en pensel snabbt"

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:10(para)
msgid "There are two methods to create a new brush:"
msgstr "Det finns två metoder för att skapa en ny pensel:"

# TODO: Clipboard image, and what about Clipboard Mask??
# TODO: Selection may be too large:
# https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gimp/-/issues/10046
#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:13(para)
msgid ""
"First, the quick temporary method. You have an image area from which you "
"want to make a brush, to be used with a tool like pencil, airbrush, etc. "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-tool-select\">Select it with the rectangular (or "
"elliptical) select tool</link>, then <guibutton>Copy</guibutton> this "
"selection. Immediately you can see this copy in the first position of the "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-brush-dialog\">Brush Dialog</link>, and its name is "
"<quote>Clipboard</quote>. It is immediately usable."
msgstr ""
"Den första metoden är snabb och tillfällig. Markera det bildområde som du "
"vill använda som pensel, till exempel med ett målarverktyg som Pennan eller "
"Färgsprutan. <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-select\">Markera området med "
"rektangulär eller elliptisk markering</link> och klicka sedan på "
"<guibutton>Kopiera</guibutton>. Kopian visas direkt först i <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-brush-dialog\">dialogrutan Penslar</link> med namnet "
"<quote>Urklipp</quote>. Du kan använda den direkt."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:22(para)
msgid ""
"This brush is temporary: it disappears when you close GIMP. You can make it "
"permanent by clicking on the <guibutton>Duplicate this brush</guibutton> at "
"the bottom of the brush panel."
msgstr ""
"Penseln är tillfällig och försvinner när du stänger GIMP. Gör den permanent "
"genom att klicka på <guibutton>Duplicera penseln</guibutton> längst ned i "
"penselpanelen."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:29(title)
msgid "Selection becomes a brush after copying"
msgstr "En markering blir en pensel efter kopiering"

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:39(para)
msgid "The second method is more elaborate."
msgstr "Den andra metoden är mer detaljerad."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:40(para)
#: src/using/animated-brushes.xml:266(para)
msgid ""
"Select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" from the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Välj "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ny…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" från huvudmenyn."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:47(para)
#: src/using/animated-brushes.xml:273(para)
msgid ""
"Set <guilabel>Width</guilabel> and <guilabel>Height</guilabel> for example "
"to 30 pixels."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in <guilabel>Bredd</guilabel> och <guilabel>Höjd</guilabel> till "
"exempelvis 30 bildpunkter."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:50(para)
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Advanced Options</guilabel>, set for example the "
"<guilabel>Color space</guilabel> to <guilabel>Grayscale</guilabel> and set "
"<guilabel>Fill with</guilabel> to <guilabel>White</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Under <guilabel>Avancerade alternativ</guilabel> kan du till exempel välja "
"<guilabel>Gråskala</guilabel> som <guilabel>Färgrymd</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Vit</guilabel> som värde för <guilabel>Fyll med</guilabel>."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:56(para)
msgid ""
"Zoom on this new image to enlarge it and draw on it with a black pencil."
msgstr ""
"Zooma in den nya bilden så att den blir större och rita i den med en svart "
"penna."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:60(para)
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Export "
"As…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Välj <menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Exportera "
"som…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> från huvudmenyn."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:67(para)
#: src/using/animated-brushes.xml:305(para)
msgid ""
"Export the image with a <filename class=\"extension\">.gbr</filename> "
"extension in the <filename class=\"directory\">brushes</filename> directory "
"located inside <link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-setup\">your personal GIMP "
"configuration folder</link>."
msgstr ""
"Exportera bilden med filändelsen <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.gbr</filename> till katalogen <filename "
"class=\"directory\">brushes</filename> i <link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-"
"setup\">din personliga GIMP-konfigurationsmapp</link>."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:72(para)
#: src/using/animated-brushes.xml:321(para)
msgid ""
"In the <link linkend=\"gimp-brush-dialog\">Brush Dialog</link>, click on the"
" button <guibutton>Refresh brushes</guibutton><placeholder-1/>."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Uppdatera penslar</guibutton><placeholder-1/> i"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-brush-dialog\">dialogrutan Penslar</link>."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:83(para)
#: src/using/animated-brushes.xml:332(para)
msgid ""
"Your brush appears among the other brushes. You can use it immediately, "
"without restarting <acronym>GIMP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Din pensel hamnar bland de andra penslarna. Du kan använda den omedelbart, "
"utan att starta om <acronym>GIMP</acronym>."

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:88(title)
msgid "Steps to create a brush"
msgstr "Steg för att skapa en pensel"

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:95(para)
msgid "Draw image, save as brush"
msgstr "Rita bilden, spara som pensel"

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:104(para)
msgid "Refresh brushes"
msgstr "Uppdatera penslar"

#: src/using/creating-brush-quickly.xml:113(para)
msgid "Use the brush"
msgstr "Använd penseln"

#. When image changes, this message will be marked fuzzy or untranslated for
#. you.
#. It doesn't matter what you translate it to: it's not used at all.
#: src/using/brushes.xml:67(None)
msgid ""
"@@image: 'images/using/file-gbr-export.png'; "
"md5=891289a728a1d5f9c911a80864a69851"
msgstr ""
"@@image: 'images/using/file-gbr-export.png'; "
"md5=891289a728a1d5f9c911a80864a69851"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:8(title)
msgid "Adding New Brushes"
msgstr "Lägg till nya penslar"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:11(secondary)
msgid "Add New"
msgstr "Lägg till ny"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:15(para)
msgid ""
"There is a quick method to add a new brush: <xref linkend=\"gimp-creating-"
"brush-quickly\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Det finns en snabb metod för att lägga till en ny pensel: <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-creating-brush-quickly\"/>."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:21(para)
msgid ""
"To add a new brush, after either creating or downloading it, you need to "
"save it in a format GIMP can use. The brush file needs to be placed in the "
"GIMP's brush search path, so that GIMP is able to index and display it in "
"the Brushes dialog. You can hit the <guibutton>Refresh</guibutton> button, "
"which reindexes the brush directory. GIMP uses three file formats for "
"brushes:"
msgstr ""
"Spara den nya penseln i ett format som GIMP stöder. Filen måste ligga i en "
"av GIMPs sökvägar för penslar för att programmet ska kunna indexera den och "
"visa den i dialogrutan Penslar. Klicka på knappen "
"<guibutton>Uppdatera</guibutton> om du vill indexera penselkatalogen på "
"nytt. GIMP stöder tre penselformat:"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:33(secondary)
msgid "File formats"
msgstr "Filformat"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:36(term) src/using/brushes.xml:39(primary)
#: src/using/brushes.xml:43(secondary)
msgid "GBR"
msgstr "GBR"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:42(primary) src/using/brushes.xml:80(primary)
#: src/using/brushes.xml:108(primary) src/using/brushes.xml:126(primary)
msgid "Formats"
msgstr "Format"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:45(para)
msgid ""
"The <filename>.gbr</filename> (\"<emphasis>g</emphasis>imp "
"<emphasis>br</emphasis>ush\") format is used for ordinary and color brushes."
" You can convert many other types of images, including many brushes used by "
"other programs, into GIMP brushes by opening them in GIMP and saving them "
"with file names ending in <filename>.gbr</filename>. This brings up a dialog"
" box in which you can set the default Spacing for the brush."
msgstr ""
"Formatet <filename>.gbr</filename> (”<emphasis>g</emphasis>imp "
"<emphasis>br</emphasis>ush”) används för vanliga penslar och färgpenslar. Du"
" kan omvandla många slags bilder till GIMP-penslar, även penslar från andra "
"program. Öppna bilden i GIMP och spara den med ett filnamn som slutar på "
"<filename>.gbr</filename>. Då öppnas en dialogruta där du kan ställa in "
"penselns standardavstånd."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:55(para)
msgid ""
"A technical specification of the GBR file format can be found on <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gimp.org/core/standards/gbr/\"> "
"developer.gimp.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"En teknisk specifikation för GBR-formatet finns på <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gimp.org/core/standards/gbr/\">developer.gimp.org</ulink>."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:61(title)
msgid "Save a <filename class=\"extension\">.gbr</filename> brush"
msgstr "Spara en <filename class=\"extension\">.gbr</filename>-pensel"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:74(term) src/using/brushes.xml:77(primary)
#: src/using/brushes.xml:81(secondary)
msgid "GIH"
msgstr "GIH"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:83(para)
msgid ""
"The <filename>.gih</filename> (\"<emphasis>g</emphasis>imp "
"<emphasis>i</emphasis>mage <emphasis>h</emphasis>ose\") format is used for "
"animated brushes. These brushes are constructed from images containing "
"multiple layers: each layer may contain multiple brush-shapes, arranged in a"
" grid. When you save an image as a <filename>.gih</filename> file, a dialog "
"comes up that allows you to describe the format of the brush. See <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-using-animated-brushes\"/> for more information about the "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Formatet <filename>.gih</filename> (”<emphasis>g</emphasis>imp "
"<emphasis>i</emphasis>mage <emphasis>h</emphasis>ose”) används för animerade"
" penslar. De skapas av bilder med flera lager. Varje lager kan innehålla "
"flera penselformer ordnade i ett rutnät. När du sparar en bild som en "
"<filename>.gih</filename>-fil öppnas en dialogruta där du kan beskriva "
"penselns format. Mer information om dialogrutan finns i <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-using-animated-brushes\"/>."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:94(para)
msgid ""
"A technical specification of the GIH file format can be found on <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gimp.org/core/standards/gih/\"> "
"developer.gimp.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"En teknisk specifikation för GIH-formatet finns på <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gimp.org/core/standards/gih/\">developer.gimp.org</ulink>."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:102(term) src/using/brushes.xml:105(primary)
#: src/using/brushes.xml:109(secondary)
msgid "VBR"
msgstr "VBR"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:111(para)
msgid ""
"The <filename>.vbr</filename> format is used for parametric brushes, i. e., "
"brushes created using the Brush Editor. There is really no other meaningful "
"way of obtaining files in this format."
msgstr ""
"Formatet <filename>.vbr</filename> används för parametriska penslar, det "
"vill säga penslar som skapas med penselredigeraren. Det finns i praktiken "
"inget annat sätt att få fram filer i det här formatet."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:120(term) src/using/brushes.xml:123(primary)
#: src/using/brushes.xml:127(secondary)
msgid "MYB"
msgstr "MYB"

#: src/using/brushes.xml:129(para)
msgid ""
"The <filename>.myb</filename> format is used for MyPaint brushes. Please "
"refer to <xref linkend=\"gimp-tool-mypaint-brush\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Formatet <filename>.myb</filename> används för MyPaint-penslar. Mer "
"information finns i <xref linkend=\"gimp-tool-mypaint-brush\"/>."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:137(para)
msgid ""
"To make a brush available, place it in one of the folders in GIMP's brush "
"search path. By default, the brush search path includes two folders, the "
"system <filename>brushes</filename> folder, which you should not use or "
"alter, and the <filename>brushes</filename> folder inside your personal GIMP"
" directory. You can add new folders to the brush search path using the <link"
" linkend=\"gimp-prefs-folders-data\">Brush Folders</link> page of the "
"Preferences dialog. Any GBR, GIH, or VBR file included in a folder in the "
"brush search path will show up in the Brushes dialog the next time you start"
" GIMP, or as soon as you press the <guibutton>Refresh</guibutton> button in "
"the Brushes dialog."
msgstr ""
"Placera penselfilen i en av mapparna i GIMPs sökväg för penslar. Som "
"standard finns två mappar där: systemmappen <filename>brushes</filename>, "
"som du inte bör använda eller ändra, och mappen <filename>brushes</filename>"
" i din personliga GIMP-katalog. Du kan lägga till mappar i sökvägen på sidan"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-folders-data\">Penselmappar</link> i dialogrutan"
" Inställningar. GBR-, GIH- och VBR-filer i en mapp på sökvägen visas i "
"dialogrutan Penslar nästa gång du startar GIMP, eller direkt när du klickar "
"på knappen <guibutton>Uppdatera</guibutton> där."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:150(para)
msgid ""
"When you create a new parametric brush using the Brush Editor, it is "
"automatically saved in your personal <filename>brushes</filename> folder."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar en parametrisk pensel med penselredigeraren sparas den "
"automatiskt i din personliga mapp <filename>brushes</filename>."

#: src/using/brushes.xml:156(para)
msgid ""
"There are a number of web sites with downloadable collections of GIMP "
"brushes. Rather than supplying a list of links that will soon be out of "
"date, the best advice is to do a search with your favorite search engine for"
" <quote>GIMP brushes</quote>. There are also many collections of brushes for"
" other programs with painting functionality. Some can be converted easily "
"into GIMP brushes, some require special conversion utilities, and some "
"cannot be converted at all. Most fancy procedural brush types fall into the "
"last category. If you need to know, look around on the web, and if you don't"
" find anything, look for an expert to ask."
msgstr ""
"Det finns flera webbplatser där du kan hämta samlingar med GIMP-penslar. I "
"stället för att lista länkar som snart blir inaktuella rekommenderar vi att "
"du söker efter <quote>GIMP brushes</quote> med din favoritsökmotor. Det "
"finns också många penselsamlingar för andra målarprogram. Vissa penslar går "
"lätt att omvandla till GIMP-format, andra kräver särskilda "
"konverteringsverktyg och en del går inte att konvertera alls. De flesta "
"avancerade procedurgenererade penslar tillhör den sista kategorin. Sök på "
"webben om du behöver mer information. Om du inte hittar svaret kan du fråga "
"en expert."

